      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Bumping this old post.\n\nWe still cannot get audio properties from players and local remote player objects that were set by udon. These settings such as Voice Gain, Voice Near & Far, Avatar Audio Gain, Avatar Audio Near & Far, and Avatar Audio Forced Spatial are able to be set to but not read.\n\nThis would allow for additive settings and better management of voice and avatar audio locally. It would also help with debugging what the current voice gain is set to after running through a bunch of zones that change the voice gain.\n\nIt's weird that we can set but not read all these properties.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
